    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "Amid widespread equipment breakdowns and a critical equipment failure at Kepco SPC Power's Unit 2, the vulnerable region of Visayas was thrust into crisis. Government authorities declared a grid emergency to protect residents from the escalating power generation issues, ordering an emergency intervention to prevent system collapse. This decisive action, while necessary, highlights the precarious state of the island region's energy security, leaving households facing a significant capacity loss and a looming blackout threat that endangers their daily lives and well-being.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "result-0",
          "result-1"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [
        "how_fragments_expanded_to_contiguous_span"
      ],
      "fit": 0.9
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Chronic infrastructure neglect and extreme weather stressing vulnerable systems culminated in a massive power shortfall for the Philippines. Emergency responders worked to issue warnings and impose rationing as the blackout probability increased, aiming to shield the island region from the worst impacts. The situation underscores a profound duty of care, where protecting the sheltered community from harm requires navigating complex operational issues and equipment malfunctions to ensure their safety and stability.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "why-1",
          "why-2",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "result-1"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "A unit malfunction at a power plant component triggered a cascade of generator failures, forcing negligent administrators to deprive residents of essential power through load shedding. This failure, occurring during a period of high power demand, exposed the geographical area to grid instability. The resulting power outage risk serves as a stark reminder of the responsibility to safeguard the community from such technical faults, demanding urgent action to restore reliable electricity and protect vulnerable households.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
